{"reviewId": "215459513_87OaF4gf5", "review": {"abstract": "2011年是第五次康波衰退的一个重要关口", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "这一年我一个小白带着5000元本金杀入股市，后面那几年经历了中国股市过山车，在中国北车和中国南车合并中国中车前，赚到了股市第一桶金。那一年牛市买什么都是赚钱的。当然不久后千股跌停的场面也随之而来，连续几日开盘即跌停的盘面让我也亏了不少。这种过山车由生至死，但又死得不彻底的心情，现在回想起来，仍心有余悸。带血的筹码多是建立在对金融风险知识的缺乏，缺少对市场的敬畏之心。如今，仍在股市浮沉，少了几分意气用事的脾性，多了几分学习学习再学习的态度。今日读此书，借此警诫自己，财富的积累并非一日可达，并无捷径可走！！！", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 215459513, "name": "👑 小胡 👑", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-qRAmSe9aI_SowMyvcusKUca/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "👑 小胡 👑", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240610-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "28046-28066", "createTime": 1774221927, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "215459513_87OaF4gf5", "userVid": 215459513, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1774222363, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 18, "likes": [{"userVid": 358086306, "name": "燕南天枫", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/3Q0NcC9KUH4nrib3hHZEiaSAViaB0HX1RuJsSeDLibCicFEzmvZCWJzjgicgQz4fNj4AFpltSVbgnGZ8ibsU8h3pNGWjXxzu84vGoBBcskib5Vcz6wQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "燕南天枫", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "自然", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV"